               rdfs:comment """It is a semiconductor diode that emits light when an electric current is applied in the forward direction of the device used to show the power status of an electrical device.

(This description is partly based on or reuses content from the Wikipedia article \"LED\" (http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Led) and is licensed under the GNU Free Documentation License (http://www.gnu.org/copyleft/fdl.html).)"""@en;
